        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-21T01:55:23.268Z",
          "html": "<p>Section 8 is rewritten as one table: the idea, today's words with where each is used and a real example, and the recommended word with why.</p>\n<p>It takes in your notes: view, not component; calculated property, its alternatives in a fold; alias kept, its four meanings spelled out. Built-in words are a \"built-in phrase\".</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-21T01:47:07.767Z"
      }
    },
    "c8": {
      "anchor": "words#code-1",
      "kind": "code",
      "label": "8. Words",
      "excerpt": "Other words for a calculated property calculated property its status is calculat",
      "text": "you are suggesting that instead of `its \"status\" is blah blah` you'd have to say `its \"status\" is a calculated property: blah blah\"?   Absolutely not.\n\nI like the names you've picked for them, but requiring people to type them in spell is a no-go.  Takes all of the elegance out of the langugage.\n\nWhat would it gain us?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-21T02:06:17.728Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "calculated property",
      "offset": 38,
      "edited": "2026-11-21T02:07:53.412Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-21T02:09:34.967Z",
          "html": "<p>No:  the Spell you write stays the same, <code>its \"status\" is \"needs water!\" if it is thirsty</code>.  \"Calculated property\" is only what the hover, the guides and messages would call it.  The words table and its fold now say so, with the hover each word would give.</p>"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "at": "2026-11-21T02:10:36.117Z",
          "text": "Whew!  OK, I like your names except let's use `formula` for your \"calculated property\"",
          "edited": "2026-11-21T02:11:27.282Z"
        },
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-21T02:11:53.983Z",
          "html": "<p>Done:  \"formula\" it is.  The words table now recommends it, marked your pick, and the hover fold shows <code>status · formula</code> first.  The other names stand.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
